  "title": "Frozen Shrimp in the Air Fryer",
  "description": "You can easily cook frozen shrimp in your air fryer. No need to defrost in advance and you will have a great appetizer or topping for pasta in minutes.",
  "authors": [
    "Bibi"
  ],
  "date_published": "2022-01-11T00:53:50-05:00",
